#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-ai.php
msgid "SM AI"
msgstr "SM AI"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-ai.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-ai.php
msgid ""
"AI assistance services, independent of the provider (Anthropic Claude, "
"OpenAI-compatible APIs): listing assistant, steel profile recognition on "
"photos, smart search, document analysis. Encrypted API keys, quotas, monthly"
" budget, usage and cost log. Suggestions only: weights come from the weight "
"engine, and AI never replaces engineering. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""
"Services d’assistance IA, indépendants du fournisseur (Anthropic Claude, API"
" compatibles OpenAI) : assistant d’annonce, reconnaissance de profilés sur "
"photo, recherche intelligente, analyse de documents. Clés API chiffrées, "
"quotas, budget mensuel, journal de consommation et de coûts. Des suggestions"
" uniquement : les poids viennent du moteur de calcul et l’IA ne remplace "
"jamais l’ingénierie. Nécessite SM Core."

#. Author of the plugin
